const moneyNames={payable:'ကုန်သည်ကို ပေးရန်',receivable:'ဝယ်သူထံမှ ရရန်',advance:'ကြိုသုံးငွေ',loan:'ကြိုထုတ်ငွေအရင်း',deposit:'ဝယ်သူ ကြိုပေးထားငွေ'};
const esc=E,copy=x=>JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(x));
const prevDate=d=>{const t=new Date(d+'T12:00:00Z');t.setUTCDate(t.getUTCDate()-1);return t.toISOString().slice(0,10);};
const dateOK=d=>/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(d||'')&&!Number.isNaN(Date.parse(d))&&new Date(d+'T12:00:00Z').toISOString().slice(0,10)===d;
const sum=(xs,f)=>xs.reduce((n,x)=>n+(Number(f(x))||0),0);
function op(){
 if(!state.initialOpening69)state.initialOpening69={schema:1,status:'draft',startDate:today(),accounts:{},own:{stock:null,rows:[],checked:false},parties:{},groups:{supplier:false,buyer:false},balances:[],dispatches:[],revisions:[]};
 const o=state.initialOpening69;
 for(const a of state.masters.accounts)if(!o.accounts[a.id])o.accounts[a.id]={amount:Number(state.bases[a.id])||0,checked:false};
 return o;
}
function editable(){return op().status==='draft';}
function mutate(){if(!editable()){toast('အတည်ပြုပြီးသော အဖွင့်စာရင်းဖြစ်ပါသည်။',true);return false;}return true;}
function partyDraft(id){const o=op();return o.parties[id]??={answers:{stock:null},rows:[],values:{payable:'',advance:'',loan:'',loanInterest:'',loanRate:'3',receivable:'',deposit:''},checked:false};}
function currentParty(){return supplierBy(ui.party);}
function saveDraft(){save();const t=document.getElementById('opening69Saved');if(t)t.textContent=storageOK?'မူကြမ်း သိမ်းထားပြီးပါပြီ':'သိမ်းမရပါ။ ဤစာမျက်နှာကို မပိတ်ပါနှင့်။';}
function inform(message){const e=document.getElementById('opening69Error')||document.getElementById('modalError');if(e){e.textContent=message;e.style.display='block';e.scrollIntoView({block:'nearest'});}else toast(message,true);return false;}
const button=(t,fn,kind='secondary',icon='')=>btn(t,fn,kind,icon);
const back=(label,fn)=>`<button type="button" class="v2-back" onclick="${fn}">${I('back')}${label}</button>`;
const money=(label,id,val,extra='')=>field(label,id,{type:'number',value:val,min:0,step:1,required:true,suffix:'ကျပ်',extra});
